<title>UK: Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs down two on week.</title>
<headline>Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs down two on week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs operating in offshore Northwestern European (NWE) waters totalled 68 in the week ending April 2, down from 70 the previous week, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>The number of rigs in U.K. waters fell one to 34 rigs while Norwegian rigs dipped two to 18. The Danish sector was unchanged at five rigs and the Dutch sector was up one at 11 rigs.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
